# Keep LF in the working tree on every OS.
#
# The index is already all-LF and CI runs on Linux. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true were getting CRLF, which made the local suite red where CI
# is green: source-string "catalog" tests expect "\n", and vitest cannot import
# scripts/seams/report.mjs when its shebang line ends in "\r".
#
# text=auto still auto-detects binaries (images, PDFs, fonts) and leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
